# The sdist exists to rebuild the wheel, nothing else. Tests are excluded
# deliberately: the conformance suites read fixtures from conformance/ at the
# repository root, which is outside this directory and therefore outside any
# sdist. Shipping the tests without the data they read gives anyone who runs
# them failures with a missing-file cause rather than a real one. Tests run in
# CI against the repository, where the fixtures exist.
prune tests
exclude conformance.pin
